  "items": [
   {
    "text": "An ocean hides",
    "start": 12,
    "end": 63
   },
   {
    "text": "under this ice.",
    "start": 63,
    "end": 124
   },
   {
    "text": "How does its water",
    "start": 135,
    "end": 187
   },
   {
    "text": "reach space?",
    "start": 187,
    "end": 230
   },
   {
    "text": "This is Enceladus,",
    "start": 310,
    "end": 390
   },
   {
    "text": "a bright, frozen moon",
    "start": 405,
    "end": 500
   },
   {
    "text": "of Saturn just",
    "start": 500,
    "end": 565
   },
   {
    "text": "504 kilometers across.",
    "start": 565,
    "end": 672
   },
   {
    "text": "Cassini measured",
    "start": 790,
    "end": 848
   },
   {
    "text": "a tiny wobble",
    "start": 848,
    "end": 896
   },
   {
    "text": "in the frozen shell.",
    "start": 896,
    "end": 975
   },
   {
    "text": "Its motion revealed",
    "start": 1003,
    "end": 1077
   },
   {
    "text": "a global ocean",
    "start": 1077,
    "end": 1133
   },
   {
    "text": "separating the ice",
    "start": 1133,
    "end": 1203
   },
   {
    "text": "from the rocky interior.",
    "start": 1203,
    "end": 1303
   },
   {
    "text": "At the south pole,",
    "start": 1326,
    "end": 1388
   },
   {
    "text": "fractures vent water vapor",
    "start": 1397,
    "end": 1499
   },
   {
    "text": "and tiny grains of ice",
    "start": 1499,
    "end": 1585
   },
   {
    "text": "into space.",
    "start": 1585,
    "end": 1637
   },
   {
    "text": "Those grains carry salts",
    "start": 1748,
    "end": 1830
   },
   {
    "text": "from the ocean below.",
    "start": 1830,
    "end": 1909
   },
   {
    "text": "Cassini data even revealed",
    "start": 1999,
    "end": 2105
   },
   {
    "text": "phosphates,",
    "start": 2105,
    "end": 2159
   },
   {
    "text": "a source of phosphorus",
    "start": 2173,
    "end": 2244
   },
   {
    "text": "essential to life",
    "start": 2244,
    "end": 2300
   },
   {
    "text": "on Earth.",
    "start": 2300,
    "end": 2339
   },
   {
    "text": "But ingredients",
    "start": 2353,
    "end": 2410
   },
   {
    "text": "are not organisms.",
    "start": 2410,
    "end": 2484
   },
   {
    "text": "Life has not",
    "start": 2496,
    "end": 2536
   },
   {
    "text": "been found here.",
    "start": 2536,
    "end": 2596
   },
   {
    "text": "The ocean itself",
    "start": 2677,
    "end": 2729
   },
   {
    "text": "stays hidden.",
    "start": 2729,
    "end": 2780
   },
   {
    "text": "Its spray does not.",
    "start": 2789,
    "end": 2868
   },
   {
    "text": "A whole world,",
    "start": 2950,
    "end": 3006
   },
   {
    "text": "sealed in ice,",
    "start": 3006,
    "end": 3069
   },
   {
    "text": "sending pieces",
    "start": 3078,
    "end": 3127
   },
   {
    "text": "of its ocean",
    "start": 3127,
    "end": 3169
   },
   {
    "text": "out into space.",
    "start": 3169,
    "end": 3229
   },
   {
    "text": "So how do you reach it?",
    "start": 3373,
    "end": 3460
   }
  ]
